WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:49.130
"Chin"

00:01:56.300 --> 00:02:00.250
"Ei Sei: King of Chin"

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:32.170
"Shou Bun Kun: Ei Sei's 
 closest retainer"

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:32.540
What is it, Sire?

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.540
Has it been a year already?

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:43.660
The Kingdom of Chin had invaded
the smaller Kan to expand its territory.

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:48.250
Neighboring Sho jumped at the chance
to draw Chin into a dangerous battle.

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:53.080
Stepping up as commanding
general was the Strange Bird of Chin:

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:58.910
Ou Ki, the last of the six great generals
feared throughout the Middle Kingdom.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.830
Sho sent forth as their
commanding general Hou Ken,

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:06.660
a so-called god of war
with deep ties to Ou Ki.

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:09.000
The two men clashed violently...

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:27.040
...just as strategist Ri Boku, one of
Sho's Three Greats, had planned.

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:32.750
Thus was Ou Ki skillfully
manipulated into dying a hero's death.

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:40.080
Without the absolute symbol of their army,
Chin's military power waned,

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:43.700
and the neighboring lands
of Sho, Gi, Kan, and So

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:46.830
started launching invasion after invasion.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:52.950
But now every Chin man, woman, and child knew:

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:56.410
The time for action had come!

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:02.620
Kill them! Squash those Chin worms!

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.120
We've got this.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:17.870
Aflame with fierce battles,
the front lines also featured

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:20.120
a group of singularly dynamic fighters.

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:24.120
Captain! New troops from the left!

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:34.370
But that's--

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.660
The Hi Shin Unit!

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:46.930
"A New Era"

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:54.120
This hundred-man squadron had come
together under Ou Ki in the Sho battle.

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:58.500
Proving their prowess there,
the Hi Shin Unit grew into a 300-man unit

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:00.410
with many ten-man sergeants.

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:09.500
The Hi Shin Unit's master swordsman, Suu Gen.

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:09.830
"Suu Gen: Sergeant"

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:18.540
The cool-headed spearman, Shou Sa.

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:18.960
"Shou Sa: Sergeant"

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:27.470
"Ryuu Sen: Sergeant"

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:27.200
The herculean Ryuu Sen.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:41.700
The clownish but hard-hitting Bi Hei.

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:42.360
"Bi Hei: Sergeant"

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:45.660
The group fighting expert, Taku Kei.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:45.860
"Taku Kei: Sergeant"

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:48.790
The oldest sergeant, Ro En.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:48.860
"Ro En: Sergeant"

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:51.580
The short-tempered and argumentative Den Ei.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:51.870
"Den Ei: Sergeant"

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:54.620
The intimidating veteran, Hai Rou.

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:54.870
"Hai Rou: Sergeant"

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.830
The dependable Den Yuu.

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:57.870
"Den Yuu: Sergeant"

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:06.010
"En: Lieutenant"

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.660
The talented leader, En.

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:25.700
She who dances down the gods of war, Kyou Kai.

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:25.780
"Kyou Kai: Lieutenant"

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:29.200
And at the head of the entire Hi Shin Unit...

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:35.580
There's the brat!

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:40.200
...is a backwater servant boy
who fought his way up the ranks

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:43.580
to command a unit 300 men strong.

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:56.160
This was none other than Shin,

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:57.730
"Shin: Captain, Hi Shin Unit, 
300-Man Squadron Leader"

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:57.870
captain of the Hi Shin Unit.

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:59.500
Shout our victory!

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:15.660
He has left me that weapon, intent on
improving himself until he is worthy of it.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:20.750
And I have been entrusted with a nation.
I haven't time to lament my helplessness.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.330
Sire.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:23.910
Shou Bun Kun.

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:26.450
I <i>will</i> bring about a unified Middle Kingdom--

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:28.620
no matter what it takes!

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:32.000
But do you have the means to defeat that man?

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:34.790
Shi Shi! By whose authority--

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:36.620
I summoned him.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:37.700
You did, Sire?

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:42.270
"Shi Shi"

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:41.370
Shi Shi: When Sei's
younger half-brother Sei Kyou

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:44.950
plotted an uprising with Ketsu Shi,
his Minister of the Left,

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:49.700
the level-headed Shi Shi gave
his support as Ketsu Shi's right hand.

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:54.160
Sei Kyou didn't bring about
an uprising because of his popularity,

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:55.950
let alone Ketsu Shi's ambition.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:59.750
It was because Shi Shi here took part in the planning.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:03.040
He had been charged with
seizing the remnants of Ketsu Shi's faction,

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.910
but now I will have him
serve as one of my close advisors.

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:08.370
There you have it.

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:10.330
As it happens, Sire,

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:13.580
we've received word of
troubling behavior from Ryo Fui.

00:08:13.580 --> 00:08:14.540
What?

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:18.370
We do not know the specifics.
I thought it best to warn Your Highness.

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:23.870
That bastard... What is he planning?

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:27.370
Now, where are you?

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:30.160
Where is my prey?

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:33.080
Aha! Gotcha!

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.750
And who might this be?

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:39.580
Well, if it isn't Sen!

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:43.910
Chin's Minister of the Right, Ryo Fui.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:47.950
Once a mere Shuu merchant,

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:48.460
"Ryo Fui: Minister of the 
Right, Kingdom of Chin"

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:51.580
his insatiable thirst for riches and fame

00:08:51.580 --> 00:08:55.410
propelled him up the ranks
to become ruler of Chin in all but name.

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:06.620
With a faction of the best in warfare,
politics, diplomacy, and law,

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:11.540
Ryo Fui had designs
on taking the Chin throne for himself.

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:16.790
Now, powerless to confront him
in the face of such naked ambition,

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:19.700
Sei's camp could only wait
for the other shoe to drop.

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:23.700
Chin's King Sei's greatest threat
may not be the surrounding nations

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:26.660
and the battles they wage.

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:29.660
Indeed, it may be Ryo Fui.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:32.250
"Meanwhile..."

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:37.200
A minor irregularity was causing a stir in Sho.

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:40.260
"Ri Boku: Chancellor, 
Kingdom of Sho"

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:40.200
Ri Boku, my lord!

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:43.750
King Tou Jou is beside himself.

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:45.770
"Kaine: 
Ri Boku's adjunct"

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:45.700
Shun Pei Kun is nowhere to be found!

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:47.660
Shun Pei Kun?

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:50.370
Yes--His Highness's favorite.

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:53.120
He would have no reason
to vanish of his own accord.

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:58.200
This could get messy.

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:01.410
Kou, wait!

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:04.700
What is it?

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:08.040
"You: Court Lady"

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:07.830
You assume your post as the king's companion today!

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.910
So why are you running away?

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:13.410
But-But-But--not me! I can't!

00:10:15.120 --> 00:10:16.120
Kou!

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:19.830
Are you all right, Kou?

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:22.200
Why <i>can't</i> you? Tell me.

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:27.330
I've had dozens of people call on me--
but always only once!

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:30.450
I'm much too childish.

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:34.410
What do you mean?
Why, His Highness said as much:

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:36.410
It's your devotion that counts!

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:38.410
Really?

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:41.830
Well, er... maybe.

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:43.040
See?!

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:46.870
Plus, I'm so clumsy...

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.500
I just know I'll make lots of mistakes here.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:55.370
Don't be silly!
We don't draw straws for this, you know.

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:57.370
You were chosen on your merits!

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.250
Now do your best.

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:11.580
I beg your pardon.

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:14.750
M-M-My name is Kou.

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:17.230
"Kou: Court Lady"

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:20.330
Starting today,
I will be your cam--er, companion!

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:24.040
Pleasure.

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:33.040
Yes, but... pleasure <i>what</i> ? And <i>how</i> ?

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:45.040
Er, um...

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:47.950
What would Your Highness like me to do first?

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:49.200
You need not do anything.

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:52.330
Just be here.

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:55.790
Y-Yes, Sire.

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:33.870
Many thanks.

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:37.450
How kind of you to come all this way.

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:42.290
It's been a while, Ryo Fui.
I'm glad to see you again.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:44.620
And I you, Lord Shun Pei Kun.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:51.580
R-Ryo Fui! Wh-What is the meaning of this?!

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:54.870
The answer to that
will have to wait until next time.

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:02.580
Shi Shi's advice came seconds too late.

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:07.410
The situation surrounding Sei
silently grew ever more tense.

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:10.950
Attacks from other kingdoms,
Ryo Fui's plotting,

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:15.160
and a darkness that lurked
in a most unexpected place...

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:27.910
And just when will I get my wish, hmm,

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:29.000
Chou Kou?

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:33.410
Madam. We have in fact
reached a conclusion in that regard.

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:36.910
Let's hear it.

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:42.000
"Shin"

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:52.000
"Shou Hei Kun: One of
Ryo Fui's Four Pillars (inner circle)"

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:55.270
"Sai Taku: One of 
Ryo Fui's Four Pillars (inner circle)"

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:55.870
Care for a drink, Shou Hei Kun?

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:58.450
This is a school, Sai Taku.

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:01.790
It's dull, waiting for the minister to make a move.

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:04.330
He does us no favors.

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:13.450
It seems the one you had
your eye on is coming along nicely.

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.790
Shin of the Hi Shin Unit?

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:20.330
Mmm. Do you still want him?

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:22.250
No.

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:23.790
So you've given up on the boy?

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:27.500
Quite the opposite.
I want to see how far he'll go.

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:30.250
We'll leave him out there for now.

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:37.250
I see... And the little strawman--
You're training him to speed Shin's progress?

00:14:37.250 --> 00:14:40.500
That I do not know.

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:47.940
"Ka Ryo Ten"

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:48.750
Can't sleep, huh, Ten?

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:53.330
"Mou Ki"

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:50.330
Mou Ki...

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:53.290
Tactician school's not easy, that's for sure.

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:57.750
I knew that coming in. Kaine told me.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:00.330
You don't understand anything.

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:05.330
If you're going to be a tactician,
you need to grasp what that really means.

00:15:05.330 --> 00:15:06.950
What it means?

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:11.450
Yes. It's far more distressing
and painful to be a tactician

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:13.700
than a soldier bleeding on the front lines.

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:16.290
Painful...

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:18.290
...and terrible.

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:28.410
It's not me I'm worried about.
I just wonder how <i>he's</i> doing.

00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:29.450
Shin?

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:33.620
Yeah... I bet he just keeps on charging onward,

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:35.620
getting farther and farther away...

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:38.120
No, sometimes he stays put.

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:42.750
He must know that
the real battle is only beginning.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.660
The real battle?

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:47.290
You can feel the times changing.

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:53.250
The battlefields are full of
young generals from Shin's generation--

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:56.370
hardworking rivals ready to butt heads.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:57.910
Hardworking rivals... huh.

00:15:57.910 --> 00:15:59.580
Like my brother.

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:04.620
You have a brother?! I've never met him!

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:09.370
He never did like to be tied down.
Loves his freedom, my brother...

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:18.700
More talented people are on their way. You'll see.

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:28.080
Check this out, Kou!

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:29.920
"Kou"

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:30.410
See, your upper arm--this bit right here?

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:35.410
Whoa! Seriously?

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:38.870
Right? Any grown-up worth his salt knows that!

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:43.620
But Tou Bi's are much softer.

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:46.410
What are you going on about?

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:52.200
How 'bout your wife, Ze?
Oh, now, see, this is a lot more like Tou Bi!

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:53.200
What?!

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:00.950
Why brood here all by your lonesome?

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:04.120
All these battles ending
in huge victories, thanks to us.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:08.000
Two-bit battles, every one of 'em.

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:11.750
What's the point
in beatin' a bunch of small fry?

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:19.250
It's not entirely pointless.
Our actions led to victory.

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:21.500
We're getting results out there.

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:25.910
This isn't about takin' on
one big name after another.

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:28.040
I get where you're coming from, but be patient.

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:31.620
Big fights don't come along every day.

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:35.290
Ri Boku!

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:36.580
Hey!

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:38.700
What the hell, Shou Sa?!

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:43.410
Act as solemn as you like--
there's nothing big on the way.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:49.120
This is the time to fatten up
our troops and store up our strength!

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:54.160
Relax a little, wouldja?
Enjoy this time with everyone.

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:56.950
That's one of the keys to a stronger squad.

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:02.580
Yeah... you're right.

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:05.080
Yes! Just like this!

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:07.790
Hey! The captain's here!

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:10.120
Here, give this a squeeze!

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:10.910
Huh?

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:12.830
This here is Tou Bi!

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:15.330
What the hell?

00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:16.450
Idiot!

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:23.200
The legend says a woman's breast
feels just like her <i>child's</i> arm!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:25.450
And besides, that's just an old wives' tale!

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:28.870
What? No way! You kiddin' me?

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:32.250
Look, I just miss Tou Bi, okay?

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:35.700
You dolt! You really are stupid, you know?

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:39.790
What's with you guys?
Don't you miss your wives and kids?

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:41.080
What about you, Taku?

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:43.410
Well, uh, actually...

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:55.540
You stay, too.

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:59.450
If it's tough gettin' all
buddy-buddy, well... I'm here.

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:00.910
No, I--

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:01.950
Come on!

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:12.370
I only wanted to relieve myself...

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:24.200
What?

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:25.870
N-Nothing.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:28.700
Yeah, right, "nothing"!

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:30.910
Lay off.

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:34.540
Have I got an embarrassing
story about Shin for you!

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:37.040
What? Oi, Bi Hei!

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:40.790
--Wait'll you hear the dirt I have on Bi Hei!
--Don't you dare!

00:19:40.790 --> 00:19:44.290
The Hi Shin Unit remained
an unattached special squadron,

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:47.290
running from battle to battle as reinforcements.

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:54.040
Their opponents weren't much of a
challenge after the pitched Sho battle,

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:56.620
and victory came quickly and often.

00:19:56.620 --> 00:20:04.830
Their allies grew to rely on them,
while their enemies learned to fear them.

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:07.500
In short, both the Hi Shin Unit's name and Shin's

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:10.830
had begun to resonate on front lines everywhere.

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:20.200
Y'know, we've gotten
awful famous for never losing a battle.

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:22.580
What if a cute girl came up to you in some village:

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:24.790
Aren't you that famous Bi Hei?

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:27.540
What would you do then, huh?

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:31.250
Huh?! A cute girl? Came up to <i>me</i> ? You mean--

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:34.160
You dummy! Tou Bi's the only girl for you!

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:37.410
Don't worry--
I'll gladly take care of the village girls.

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:40.120
Well, but--hang on! I have rights, too!

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:41.450
Bad news!

00:20:41.450 --> 00:20:43.410
Bad, terrible, awful!

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:47.160
Kei, Kou! What is it? An enemy?

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:49.370
N-No, it's not that...

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:54.500
Word is there was a huge battle
between the En and the Sho!

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:57.500
The En...

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:58.620
...and the Sho?

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:01.690
"Kei"

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:01.120
Just as we thought!

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:06.620
And the general who led the
Sho against the En was... Ri Boku!

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.950
Well? How did it turn out?!

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:17.700
Ri Boku... toppled two huge
En castles, Busui and Hojo.

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:25.160
Busui and Hojo?
But those castles are impregnable.

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:30.080
It was terribly one-sided.
The En army was completely helpless.

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:33.580
So he's making his move.

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:34.580
Mmm.

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:36.750
All right! Time for us to--

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:38.750
Save your swagger.

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:40.120
Shou Sa!

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:43.080
En's way off in the
opposite direction from Chin.

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:47.620
If Sho went after En,
they must be looking eastward.

00:21:47.620 --> 00:21:52.080
Which means we won't be facin' 'em any time soon.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:55.000
If we're preoccupied with an
enemy we aren't goin' to fight,

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:57.580
the small fry might just sneak up on us.

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:00.250
Good point.

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:04.000
Yes. Shou Sa's right.

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:08.790
But something even more unexpected
was happening over in Kanyou.

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:10.330
Oh, no!

00:22:10.790 --> 00:22:13.330
Mou Ki! Ka Ryo Ten! This is big!

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:16.200
What happened, Kou Wa?

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:20.370
The Sho--their chancellor! He's coming to Chin!

00:22:21.790 --> 00:22:23.250
Sho's chancellor?!

00:22:23.250 --> 00:22:26.080
He's coming here of his own accord? But why?

00:22:26.750 --> 00:22:30.120
We don't know... but he's definitely coming!

00:22:30.120 --> 00:22:32.830
The palace has been thrown into utter chaos!

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:38.330
And after last year's invasion...
What could he be up to?

00:22:39.160 --> 00:22:42.330
B-But that's not the only shocking news!

00:22:42.330 --> 00:22:43.200
Huh?

00:22:43.200 --> 00:22:45.660
Ready? Take a deep breath and listen close!

00:22:45.660 --> 00:22:47.620
Mou Ki, Ka Ryo Ten...

00:22:47.620 --> 00:22:50.910
The Sho chancellor that will be visiting Chin...

00:22:53.290 --> 00:22:54.950
...is none other than...

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:14.540
...Ri Boku!

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:51.750
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:54.830
<i>Why would the voice that melted into the sky</i>

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:59.450
<i>Peel away and disappear?</i>

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.790
<i>Just a single word</i>

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.830
<i>If that's all you'd say</i>

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:11.700
<i>What kind of word would you choose?</i>

00:24:12.540 --> 00:24:15.910
<i>Holding my breath and making sure</i>

00:24:15.910 --> 00:24:18.870
<i>The heartbeat can't wait</i>

00:24:18.870 --> 00:24:24.830
<i>If I let go of your hand, I'll want even more</i>

00:24:24.830 --> 00:24:28.450
<i>And so I keep on doing this</i>

00:24:28.450 --> 00:24:30.910
<i>Not allowing myself to stop</i>

00:24:30.910 --> 00:24:35.700
<i>Because I'm still searching for answers</i>

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:39.370
<i>I want you to tell me</i>

00:24:41.700 --> 00:24:46.200
<i>Before you melt away into the sky</i>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:57.970
"Next Episode Preview"

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:07.020
"The Quiet Battlefield"
